  "_comment": "POCSAG scanner — DAPNET (Europe amateur pager network, 439.9875 MHz). For US commercial paging try 152–159 or 454–460 MHz instead. Uses peak_marker to auto-tune the pocsag decoder onto the actual carrier if tuning is slightly off. Increase gain if signal is weak; drop it if the RTL-SDR is overloading. With an LNA at the antenna, use gain around 18–22 dB instead of 32.",
